===
title: Multi-step argument
author: Ann
language: de
===

[Tax]: A sugar tax should be introduced.

<Health chain>: Taxing sugar improves health.

(1) [Price]: A tax raises the price of sugary drinks.
(2) [Demand]: Higher prices lower demand.
-- Modus ponens --
(3) [Less sugar]: People drink fewer sugary drinks.
(4) [Health]: Less sugar means fewer health problems.
--
Inference to the best explanation
{uses: [3, 4]}
--
(5) [Tax]
    <- [Regressive]: A sugar tax hits poor households hardest.
